> "floating wand wresting trick" - what the heck is that?

http://nethackwiki.com/wiki/Bug#C343-246

This is also called "lev-wresting". Levitate, adjust the wand you want
to wrest to slot "E", then just keep "E" pressed until you get the "You
wrest one last charge from the worn-out wand.--More--" prompt. This is
a 0-turn action, i.e. it does NOT consume ANY turns. It can be used to
safely wrest a wand of wishing on Astral, for example.

This bug is still exploitable in most forks/variants including NAO.

