http://nethackwiki.com/wiki/Bug#SC343-8
(The link to the TAS writeup there has a more detailed explanation.)

Berry used it in Junethack 2012 for a 64-bit MAXINT score ascension.

This is also used in ais523/dwangoAC's tool-assisted speed-run (goal:
ascension in 2015 turns) to overflow the gold counter which basically
results in unlimited carrying capacity.

This bug is probably fixed in most active forks/variants (including
NAO), but the older, unmaintained ones might allow it.


